// (OpenUSD sdf/crateFile.cpp _RecursiveWrite/_RecursiveRead). The fixture below
// is a real pxr-authored .usdc (generated by OpenUSD `usdcat`) containing a
// nested stage customLayerData dict, prim customData/assetInfo (incl. token[]),
